    exps: [], given: '',
    close: { code: 'SOL-11', kind: 'SOL', text: 'Every list runs from general to specific; goals, optimizations and principles are also in order of priority, with leeway: in a trade-off the higher one wins, and a large loss to it is never bought with a small gain to a lower one. Constraints have no priority, since none gives way. Codes stay with their clauses when they move.' },
