    close: { code: 'OUT-33', kind: 'OUT', verdict: 'worked', text: 'One sampled cell per part never brought the rest back; two always did, with 30 links per composition against 132 for wiring everything, far fewer intrusions (45% clean against 17% at 500 compositions) and about a fiftieth of the work. As memory filled, recall spread into other compositions; competition within columns did not stop it.' },
