    exps: ['C74', 'C75', 'C76', 'C77'], given: '',
    close: { code: 'SOL-13', kind: 'SOL', text: 'CTR-1: cell, segment and assembly defined (DEF-12 to DEF-14); CON-19 (draft): the dynamics fall out of cells and their segments, nothing loops over whole assemblies; OPZ-5 restated: the work of receiving and recalling grows with what is active, not with what is stored. CTR-2: bookkeeping defined (DEF-11); CON-8 (draft): bookkeeping allowed in experiments, declared, never in the core; what is already there is a violation to distil.' },
