    close: { code: 'OUT-35', kind: 'OUT', verdict: 'worked', text: 'Read through the top level of support, the cut found the right wall, roof and new roof in 100% of families; decomposed and rebound costs 114 links against 264; with bindings competing as whole memories each roof brought back its own whole (other roof 0-4%; clean 96-97% at 64 cells per column, 200 families). Without the top level the cut was right in 9-38%; read plainly, the shared wall woke both.' },
