    close: { code: 'OUT-37', kind: 'OUT', verdict: 'worked', text: 'After one reading, the last word of "the S V the O" was predicted right and sharply every time in both worlds, where one cell per word predicted every object of the verb (5.6 and 14.9 words); a newcomer predicted only valid objects through its column. Learning from winners was needed (66% without it on dev). Least-used beat random slightly. The word after the first creeps: three readings used 63% more cells.' },
