    close: { code: 'OUT-38', kind: 'OUT', verdict: 'worked', text: 'After one reading of 400 sentences: next letter inside words right 98%, alone 67-75% (one cell per letter 27-38%); without spaces, boundaries where the breadth of prediction peaks 76% precision, 83% recall (one cell per letter 53 / 61%); surprise alone found 15%. Work per letter 46-63 segment checks, against about 100 for one cell per letter.' },
    lessons: [{ code: 'CLM-27', kind: 'CLM', text: 'Words begin where many letters were predicted and one lit: the second kind of heat, not surprise, finds the boundaries.' }],
